  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "绑定即注册",
      "items": [
        "setViewPager 先解绑旧 Pager，再 view.setOnPageChangeListener(this)，指示器自身就是监听器",
        "Pager 无 adapter 时直接抛 IllegalStateException，避免画不出页数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "绘制与转发",
      "items": [
        "回调只记录 mCurrentPage / mPageOffset，然后 invalidate 交给 onDraw 统一重画",
        "若 setOnPageChangeListener 传入了外部监听，回调末尾原样转发三个方法"
      ]
    }
  ]
